B.W2=new A.G(B.n,["Face effects in the camera studio use MediaPipe Face Landmarker, served from YuMapAI's own site. Change notice (20.11.2026): usage logging (telemetry) in vision_bundle was turned off; the model is unchanged. Face data is processed only on your device and is never sent or stored.","Kamera st\xfcdyosundaki y\xfcz efektleri MediaPipe Face Landmarker'\u0131 kullan\u0131r; dosyalar YuMapAI'\u0131n kendi sitesinden gelir. De\u011fi\u015fiklik beyan\u0131 (20.11.2026): vision_bundle i\xe7indeki kullan\u0131m g\xfcnl\xfc\u011f\xfc (telemetri) kapat\u0131ld\u0131; model de\u011fi\u015ftirilmedi. Y\xfcz verisi yaln\u0131z cihaz\u0131nda i\u015flenir, hi\xe7bir yere g\xf6nderilmez ve saklanmaz."],t.w)
